"ARCHITECTURE CNN (§2.5)\n\n"
"Input (32,32,3)\n"
"  ↓  Conv1 [64 filtres 3×3×3] + ReLU → (32,32,64)\n"
"  ↓  Conv2 [64 filtres 3D 3×3×64] + ReLU → (32,32,64)\n"
"  ↓  MaxPool 2×2 → (16,16,64)\n"
"  ↓  Conv3 [64 filtres 3D] + ReLU → (16,16,64)\n"
"  ↓  MaxPool 2×2 → (8,8,64)\n"
"  ↓  Conv4 [64 filtres 3D] + ReLU → (8,8,64)\n"
"  ↓  Flatten → vecteur 4096\n"
"  ↓  Dense(4096→10) + Softmax\n\n"
"FORMULES CLÉS :\n\n"
"Convolution (§2.3) :\n"
"  m'_{u,v} = ΣΣ K_{u',v'} m_{u+u'-2,v+v'-2} + l\n\n"
"Gradient filtre (rétropropagation, §2.6.1) :\n"
"  ∂L/∂K_{u',v',c} = Σ_{u,v} δ_{u,v} · m_{u+u'-2,v+v'-2,c}\n\n"
"MaxPool — gradient sparse :\n"
"  gradient = 0 sauf au pixel maximum\n\n"
"Gradient dense + softmax + cross-entropy :\n"
"  δ_sortie = P − Y    (sans terme σ', cf. poly ch.3)\n"
"  dW = (1/n) δ · zᵀ\n\n"
"Évanouissement du gradient évité :\n"
"  • activation ReLU (dérivée = 0 ou 1)\n"
"  • fonction coût Log Loss (pas de σ' dans δ)"
)
